##fileformat=VCFv4.2
##FILTER=<ID=PASS,Description="All filters passed">
##contig=<ID=ExampleGenome,length=159>
##INFO=<ID=CD8SCAPE_TEST,Number=1,Type=String,Description="Expected CD8scape filter outcome for this variant">
##
## Synthetic VCF designed to exercise all three CD8scape filtering stages
## against the 159-nt single-ORF example genome (Minimal protein, pos 1-159).
##
## Stage 1 — Frame filter
##   OUT OF FRAME : variant position outside any annotated ORF
##   IN FRAME     : position falls within the ORF (1-159)
##
## Stage 2 — Peptide filter (in-frame variants only)
##   SYNONYMOUS   : nucleotide change does not alter the amino acid
##   STOP CODON   : change introduces a premature stop
##   NON-SYN      : amino acid changes -> proceeds to binding filter
##
## Stage 3 — Binding filter (non-synonymous variants only)
##   Result depends on netMHCpan scores for the alleles in alleles.txt.
##   18 non-synonymous variants are included across the full 53-AA protein
##   to ensure multiple binding hits.
##
## Nucleotide positions reference the consensus sequence in consensus.fa.
## Amino-acid positions are 1-based within the Minimal protein ORF.
##
#CHROM	POS	ID	REF	ALT	QUAL	FILTER	INFO
